
MINI PROJECT 1

Project Title: TOURISM : URBAN TRAFFIC DATA ANALYTICS 

Project Description:
Urban transportation systems face challenges due to fluctuating traffic volume, varying vehicle speeds, changing traffic density, weather conditions, and accident occurrences. This project addresses these challenges by transforming raw traffic records into structured business intelligence using Power BI and Tableau to evaluate traffic trends, location-wise vehicle volume, traffic density, vehicle types, accident patterns, weather impact, and traffic risk levels.

